      ],
      "explanation": "\\(\\angle 1+\\angle 2=180^\\circ\\) and \\(\\angle 1=3\\angle 2\\), so \\(4\\angle 2=180^\\circ\\), \\(\\angle 2=45^\\circ\\), and \\(\\angle 1=135^\\circ\\).",
